
### `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Environment variables
.env

# IDE/editor
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Testing/cache
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Build artifacts
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/